{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/beneath-the-sea/1130433-hopefully-on-topic-they-came-from-beneath-the-sea","id":1130433,"title":"Hopefully on topic: They Came from Beneath the Sea!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","They Came From...","...Beneath the Sea!"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-17T13:20:48-07:00","id":1130433,"title":"Hopefully on topic: They Came from Beneath the Sea!","content":"Nobody else is posting about this that I can find on the forums, probably for the same reason I almost didn't: that they weren't quite sure where <i>to</i> post about it. I quote from the penultimate page (probably the inside back cover in the print edition) of the Gen Con Brochure: <div align=\"center\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <i>&quot;Drive into town. Punch a gillman.<br /> Grab a dollar 'shake. Wrestle an aquaterpillar.<br /> Take my date to the drive-in theatre.<br /> Fight a small army of crab-folk.<br /> <br /> Just a regular damn day since<br /> those bastards came from beneath the sea!&quot;<br /> - Big Jim Murdoch</i><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:22px\">THEY CAME FROM BENEATH THE SEA!</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\">KICKSTARTER COMING 2018</span></b> </div> </div> </div></div> <br /> Is this a WoD game, I wondered? A CofD game? Somehow fitted into one of the Path-owned properties? So I did some googling to see if anyone was using the phrase, and I found a <a href=\"http://ukgamesexpo.co.uk/gming.php\" target=\"_blank\">post</a> on the UK Games Expo site from the Gentleman Gamer himself, OPP contributor Matthew Dawkins, including the following tidbit:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matthew Dawkins</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#636466\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">At this year\u2019s UK Games Expo I will be running an as-yet unpublished game of my own creation called \u2018They Came From Beneath The Sea!\u2019 which is a combination of my love for B-Movies and sci-fi horror. My intent isn\u2019t just to self-promote but to get some actual playtesting from a diverse range of players who don\u2019t necessarily know me.</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>And, just like that, it went to something I might back when the Kickstarter goes live to something I probably will, and something I had an idea where to talk about. And here I am. And how are <i>you</i> today?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1426-aberranteyes","name":"AberrantEyes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1426_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-17T13:38:36-07:00","id":1130443,"title":"","content":"Hmmmm! OPP expanding their repertoire with more creator-owned games is cool, and I can appreciate some supernatural pulp horror that doesn't fit with the Chronicles of Darkness or suit the tone of World of Darkness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby"